# A defending player's snow Forest with all basic land types is a snow Swamp, so Legions cannot be blocked; a different attacker can (CR 702.14c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Legions of Lim-Dûl
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Snow-Covered Forest
Black Lotus
Prismatic Omen
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Legions of Lim-Dûl.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Snow-Covered Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Prismatic Omen.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Legions of Lim-Dûl > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Legions of Lim-Dûl)
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Legions of Lim-Dûl.Tapped = true
